<% content_for :title, "Mania & Hypomania Relapse Plan | Bipolar Sober" %>

<main class="relapse-plan-page">

  <section class="relapse-plan-hero">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <%= link_to "← ALL RELAPSE PLANS", toolbox_relapse_plans_path,
          class: "relapse-plan-back" %>

      <p class="relapse-plan-eyebrow">
        BIPOLAR SOBER / RELAPSE PLANS / MANIA &amp; HYPOMANIA
      </p>

      <h1>
        <span>FEELING</span>
        <span>FUCKING</span>
        <span>INVINCIBLE?</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="relapse-plan-intro">
        MY PLAN FOR STAYING SOBER WHEN MY MOOD HEADS UP.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-pink">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">01 / MY PATTERNS</p>
      <h2>WHEN UP<br>STARTS SHIFTING.</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-copy">
        <p>[Write about your experience of mania, hypomania, and drinking.]</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-black">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">02 / MY WARNING SIGNS</p>
      <h2>WHAT CHANGES<br>FOR ME?</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>SLEEP &amp; ENERGY</h3>
          <p>[Write your personal warning signs around sleep and energy.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>THOUGHTS &amp; CONFIDENCE</h3>
          <p>[Write the changes you recognize in your thinking and confidence.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>BEHAVIOR &amp; DECISIONS</h3>
          <p>[Write the changes you notice in your actions and decisions.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>THE DRINKING ARGUMENT</h3>
          <p>[Write how you start justifying alcohol when your mood is elevated.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-yellow">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">03 / MY RESPONSE</p>
      <h2>MAKE THE PLAN<br>BEFORE THE PITCH.</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY FIRST STEPS</h3>
          <p>[Write your specific actions when you recognize these patterns.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY ENVIRONMENT</h3>
          <p>[Write your plan for situations, access to alcohol, and decisions.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="relapse-plan-section relapse-plan-purple">
    <div class="relapse-plan-container">
      <p class="relapse-plan-label">04 / MY SUPPORT PLAN</p>
      <h2>WHO GETS<br>THE HEADS-UP?</h2>

      <div class="relapse-plan-grid">
        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>PEOPLE I TRUST</h3>
          <p>[Add contacts, what you want to tell them, and your backup.]</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relapse-plan-box">
          <h3>MY CLINICAL &amp; SAFETY PLAN</h3>
          <p>[Add your agreed care instructions, warning signs requiring more support, and urgent steps.]</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>